  "body": "ChipWave Tracker 0.2.3.4\n\n**Download:** `ChipWave-0.2.3.4-setup-x64.exe` (installer) or the portable zip. The installer is not code-signed yet, so SmartScreen may warn: click \"More info\" then \"Run anyway\".\n\nNew since 0.2.3:\n- **New demo song \"Lumen Drift\"**: an original 140 BPM trance track (File > New from demo song, or Help > Load demo song)\n- **Sidechain ducking**: pick a key channel in the mixer and set Duck % per channel\n- **Synth LFO** (tempo-synced) for filter sweeps, volume gates and pitch wobble; wide stereo supersaws\n- **808-style metal hi-hats**, per-note decay effect `08xx`, velocity-to-cutoff, start delay for laid-back percussion\n- Sample-accurate row timing (first row after Play no longer early)\n- Instrument right-click menu: Add effect, Copy/Paste effects, Open in FX view\n- Toolbar Chord spread and Rec step/live toggles next to the MIDI light\n- Mixer double-click resets faders and pan\n- Help > About: credits and support links\n\nCreated by Del (postmanpat). Like it? [Buy me a coffee](https://buymeacoffee.com/postmanpat) or [PayPal](https://paypal.me/derekh100).\n\nEarly version, expect rough edges. GPL-3.0.\n"
